# SEPA XSD Schema Files

This directory should contain the official SEPA XSD schema files:
- `pain.001.001.03.xsd` - Credit Transfer schema
- `pain.008.001.02.xsd` - Direct Debit schema

You can download these schemas from:
- ISO 20022 official repository: https://www.iso20022.org/
- SEPA official documentation

The XsdValidator will work even if these files are not present (validation will be skipped),
but for full validation, you should download and place the XSD files here.
